{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Shopping Spree", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Fancy Meeting You Here", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Making Comparisons", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">as</span> + adjective/adverb + <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons when the things we are comparing are equal in some way:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">She is just <span class=\"strong\">as hardworking as</span> we are!</span><br/><br/>We use not <span class=\"italic\">as</span> ... <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons between things which aren't equal:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">   The clothes are<span class=\"strong\">n't as cheap as</span> I expected though!</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "They're not made <span class=\"strong\">as well today as</span> they were twenty years ago.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm here <span class=\"strong\">as often as</span> I can be.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She's not <span class=\"strong\">as exacting as</span> some I've worked for.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Alright! I'm not <span class=\"strong\">as difficult as</span> you may think Sally! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Older garments that are not <span class=\"strong\">as seasonal as</span> these are back here. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Superlatives/Comparatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class=\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing.<br/><br/>You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class=\"strong\">group</span> that he, she or it belongs to.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for information on how to form the comparative and superlative:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cool\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cooler\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the coolest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Most adjectives:<br/><br/>+er, +-est\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"late\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"later\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectives ending in -e:<br/><br/>+r, +-st\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"happy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"happier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the happiest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2-syllable adje\u00ad\u00ad\u00adctives ending in -y:<br/><br/>+ier, +iest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"interesting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more interesting \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most interesting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3+-syllable adjectives:<br/><br/>more + adjective<br/><br/>most + adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good<br/>bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)<br/>worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best<br/>the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular comparisons\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<ul><li>you use <span class=\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives</li><li>you add <span class=\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The pace is slower here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You have better taste than most.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "These are some of our finest frocks!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They're higher quality than at your typical second-hand shop. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "second-hand", "type": "name"}, {"content": "already used or worn", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Vintage clothes are higher quality than the ones at a typical second-hand ones.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you are talking about colleagues.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "truth be told", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the truth is ...", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Truth be told, I'm a bit of a workaholic.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gem", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something precious", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Melodie is a gem at the restaurant. I don't know what I'd do without her!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hardworking", "type": "name"}, {"content": "works to the fullest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's a very hardworking individual.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "attentive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "listens carefully to and helps", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's extremely attentive to her customers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "esteemed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "well thought of ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is highly esteemed by her peers. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "impressive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you respect or admire", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's an impressive display of food!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "attribute", "type": "name"}, {"content": "characteristic", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Melodie has impressive attributes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "exacting", "type": "name"}, {"content": "demanding", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Vanessa is not as exacting as some bosses.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of a friend or classmate that you know well.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe the friend's personality and behavior.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare your personalities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a 100-word descriptive paragraph about your friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I describe the personality and behavior of someone I know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make comparisons between my personality and the person I know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a description of the person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my description aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This vintage shop is just the coolest place. The clothes aren't as cheap as I expected though!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: They're higher quality than at your typical second-hand shop. Look at these sweaters! They're not made as well today as they were twenty years ago.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Melodie</span>: Can I help you ladies?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Melodie! You work here?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Melodie</span>: I'm here as often as I can be. Truth be told, I'm a bit of a workaholic."}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob05re2img02.jpg", "time": "24200", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I should say so, working here and at the restaurant! When do you go out? When do you socialize? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Melodie</span>:  It's only once a week. The pace is slower here. I get to meet people.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally, this is Melodie. She's one of my best waiters. She's a gem - hardworking, attentive to customers and highly esteemed by her colleagues!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Those are impressive attributes! I hear Vanessa can be quite demanding!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Melodie</span>: She's not as exacting as some I've worked for.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Alright! I'm not as difficult as you may think Sally!"}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "56500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmm ... Let's return to a more interesting topic, like finery!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Melodie</span>: Our latest additions are here. Older garments that are not as seasonal as these are back here. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally, you're in good hands. Melodie's a real go-getter!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ooo ... those are gorgeous! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Melodie</span>: You have better taste than most. These are some of our finest frocks! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll just make myself comfortable. Sally is the consummate leisurely shopper."}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le07ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le07ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about behavior, personality, and socializing.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can make comparisons using <span class=\"italic\">as ... as</span> and <span class=\"italic\">not as</span>. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can compare two things or people and describe the quality of an object or a person.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you shop for second-hand or vintage clothing or other items?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Where can you find these things in or near your city?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"